msgid "UI действие"
msgstr "UI Action"

#: ../../general/Tech_func_descr/Preview/Content_transformation.rst:136
msgid ""
"Действие для трансформации описано в разделе UI действий с ID "
"``transform`` :ref:`здесь <ui_actions>`"
msgstr ""
"The transformation action is described in the UI actions section with ID "
"``transform`` :ref:`here <ui_actions>`"
